# Result  : EVERY route returns HTTP 500 "Internal Server Error" (text/plain), including
#           routes that need no authentication at all (/, /demo, /features, /pricing,
#           /contact, /privacy, /terms, and the 404 route).
# Cause   : src/proxy.js exports clerkMiddleware(), whose matcher is
#           ["/((?!.*\\..*|_next).*)", "/", "/(api|trpc)(.*)"] — so the proxy runs on
#           every non-asset request, and Clerk throws before the route is reached.
# Verdict : BUG-015 — a single missing env var takes the entire site (marketing pages
#           included) down with an opaque 500 rather than a clear startup failure.
